{"version":1,"key":"card:415","content":{"id":415,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"隐写术是指将一个文件隐藏在另一个文件中，一个最常见的例子就是藏头诗，把信息藏在诗的开头，或者诗的其它位置。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在计算机中，可以使用图片来传递隐藏的文件信息。对于一副图片，每个像素有 rgb 三个通道，每个通道使用一个字节表示，如果使用图片 rgb 每个通道的最后一个比特来传递信息，由于最后一个比特对整幅图片的影响不大，人眼几乎无法分别，可以做到在不影响原图的情况下隐藏另一个文件。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于大小为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"w \\cdot h","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"w \\cdot h"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿ 的图片，其包含 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"w \\cdot h \\cdot 3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"w \\cdot h \\cdot 3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿ 个字节，可以传递 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"w \\cdot h \\cdot 3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"w \\cdot h \\cdot 3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿ 个比特的信息，假设图片的大小为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"1024 \\cdot 720","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1024 \\dcot 720"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么可以传递 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"1024 \\cdot 720 \\cdot 3 \\, \\text{bit} = 2211840 \\, \\text{bit} = 276440 \\, \\text{Byte} = 270 \\text{kB}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2211840 bit"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 大小的信息，甚至可以事先对文件进行压缩，实际可以传递的文件大小可以大于 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"270  \\text{kB}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"270kB"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"tags":["安全/隐写术","加密/隐写术"],"createTime":1711275105778,"updateTime":1743303640429,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640429}}